{"game": "arc-raiders", "language": "english", "appid": 1808500, "month": "2026-02", "window": 2, "start_date": 1770508800, "end_date": 1771113599, "month_true_total": 19053, "quota": 29, "returned": 29, "pulled_at": "2026-09-10 21:18:36 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "218340514", "author": {"steamid": "76561199071412616", "personaname": "Front4lLeak", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199071412616/", "num_games_owned": 165, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 14720, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14706, "last_played": 1787258509, "avatar": "299cac7229b704c9333a4ae683f8221de58f0b10"}, "language": "english", "review": "The devs must've been glue sniffers growing up. They made a good game then proceeded to kurt cobain themselves by not listening to the community and changing ♥♥♥♥ that doesn't need to be changed like the eletromagnetic cloak, or making certain gun rarities break even faster, and the updates are just lackluster in general. Their version of a \"crossover\" is just importing assets from a different game they developed themselves, embark is too busy hosting circle jerks for their devs rather than working on the game like we want them to. ", "timestamp_created": 1771113538, "timestamp_updated": 1785257771, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.524886906147003174", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218340235", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056867106", "personaname": "Phantomise", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198056867106/", "num_games_owned": 96, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 2245, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1134, "last_played": 1777836898, "avatar": "ea29c0c6d7ef824c6610c62eddeb63065f5379b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm becoming so addicted to this game that I have started dreaming about finding blueprints and asking my girlfriend if she's friendly.\n\n10/10 Would recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1771113235, "timestamp_updated": 1771113235, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218340219", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044318673", "personaname": "FishyFornicator", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044318673/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 78211, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3381, "playtime_at_review": 27129, "deck_playtime_at_review": 7, "last_played": 1789099732, "avatar": "233f6ab700b2092420540644292aeff68b7ceb46"}, "language": "english", "review": "come here raider, come here", "timestamp_created": 1771113219, "timestamp_updated": 1771113219, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218340207", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064180961", "personaname": "BoricuaGabe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198064180961/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 63128, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 57777, "deck_playtime_at_review": 876, "last_played": 1772627228, "avatar": "ddd4b378fcd2775422a627add827dd19270f8395"}, "language": "english", "review": "I absolutely love this game but at this point I can’t recommend this game to anyone unless Embark changes something with how they handle cheaters. Giving people 3 chances before they get perma banned for cheating is a joke. When you get into the more aggressive lobbies, cheating is very rampant. Embark needs to toughen up on cheaters before it’s too late.", "timestamp_created": 1771113204, "timestamp_updated": 1771113204, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218340116", "author": {"steamid": "76561199209259838", "personaname": "Konri002", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199209259838/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1450, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 777, "last_played": 1772420448, "avatar": "ecb9ccc84ce691bd2c624e8e45e33626045ad4d7"}, "language": "english", "review": "love this game bring friends!", "timestamp_created": 1771113107, "timestamp_updated": 1771113107, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218340081", "author": {"steamid": "76561198354125257", "personaname": "NyquilOverdoze", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198354125257/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 6490, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2460, "last_played": 1782696372, "avatar": "e26ac1f188a8555d908e6cb14e38f80c2d903e71"}, "language": "english", "review": "peak", "timestamp_created": 1771113088, "timestamp_updated": 1771113088, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218339990", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018045383", "personaname": "Camo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018045383/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 6504, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4792, "last_played": 1773309727, "avatar": "a3a333842695052e20ee6b2e4475d689f3fdd3ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly, the game itself is pretty fun. brings out the best and worst of people. but technically the game is a disaster for me... keeps crashing. And I tried A LOT of things...\n\n- update bios\n- update gpu drivers\n- roll back gpu drivers to all kinds of \"stable\" versions\n- changes in the registry\n- ...\n\nand nothing seems to help... I just want to be able to load in a game with my expensive stuff, and not lose it to crashing...\n\nedit:\n\nI disabled MPO on my computer, which is something one should not have to do to play this game...\nbut none the less... this solved my crashing issue. so now it seems like I can happily lose my expensive loadouts to rats like any other normal raider out there.", "timestamp_created": 1771112993, "timestamp_updated": 1771430631, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218339889", "author": {"steamid": "76561199886096474", "personaname": "tempiozach8520", "persona_status": "online", "pro