454, "last_played": 1771111986, "avatar": "ee6382998e88837105c65f1af78cfd8210a7b7b3"}, "language": "english", "review": "What a garbage game. Full of spawn and exfil campers and rats are everywhere. Every time I helped take down a Queen or Matriarch, using lots of expensive armaments, I get shot in the back afterwards by a Raider while trying to loot the Arc. Super toxic PvP, no different from any other extraction shooter. I was hoping for a more balanced game but I should have known better. I would NOT recommend this game to anyone, it is a huge waste of time and money, especially considering how long you have to grind to get any gear that is worth having and how repetitive and boring the game gets after the first 30 hrs. or so.", "timestamp_created": 1771112541, "timestamp_updated": 1771112541, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480548053979873657", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218339565", "author": {"steamid": "76561198398053684", "personaname": "MGB72", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198398053684/", "num_games_owned": 207, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 2947, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1601, "last_played": 1779033081, "avatar": "44bd4dfce575700ae560313590398f95a1a599a8"}, "language": "english", "review": "a little buggy but still pretty fun", "timestamp_created": 1771112499, "timestamp_updated": 1771340004, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218339525", "author": {"steamid": "76561199689756914", "personaname": "CEATEA", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199689756914/", "num_games_owned": 11, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 21909, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18264, "last_played": 1782864805, "avatar": "fd9c8433327b391f2251f90ab43e3d2b81997644"}, "language": "english", "review": "feELS GOOD TO KILL", "timestamp_created": 1771112440, "timestamp_updated": 1771112440, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218339519", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054965224", "personaname": "Brielle Labingi", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198054965224/", "num_games_owned": 288, "num_reviews": 104, "playtime_forever": 13782, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13745, "last_played": 1778535495, "avatar": "8ee06c83af9881c2b4bb5a29362b1978ac00a50c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Peaachxo [X]\nNessieDoes [✓] \n\nArc Raiders is so much fun, the PVE is really cool mechanically and when mingled with the PVP it can make for some really intense and unique firefights. \n\nI do wish some QoL updates were made to make the little loading screen messages a tad more refined and poignant for the scenario. The workbenches upgrade menus were confusing to find and need weird item combinations to upgrade. Small gripes for a fantastic game.", "timestamp_created": 1771112437, "timestamp_updated": 1775924523, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218339488", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989411426", "personaname": "Ferroflame", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ferroflame/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 7300, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7251, "last_played": 1772483222, "avatar": "0ccb5c80dbc4f22a81575dc990fb5cd4b30d37b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "What would be a good game is ruined by PVP trolls who will always get the first hit and always win if you try to play friendly, which is the entire point of the game.\n\nShields are useless. Hitpoints are insanely low. You die practically at the suggestion of someone shooting at you. Even PvE ARC kill you in 2 hits, even the small ones. \n\nThis game is fun to play with friends but it's insufferable to play alone.\n\nEven with the underlying karma system that's supposed to put you in appropriate lobbies, it still fails. \n\nThere's no way to tell a PKer apart from a friendly person at all besides witnessing them attack other players. \n\nPKers should be made to be distinctive from friendly players. The game should ask you if you are trying to play friendly or not. There should be more of a separation between friendly players and non-friendly players. You should be able to see a PKer a mile away and know they're a threat.\n\nThere are people who work together as intended and there are troll ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ losers who want to treat every game they play like CoD. Lets have some distinction between the two. The PKers are not trying to rebuild humanity or save anyone, they're playing a different game entirely. Give them different quests, different NPCs, put them in a whole other area. Speranza is not for them. \n\nThere should be a whole different game for the people who want to attack others and play that way. They aren't ARC Raiders, they are Human Murderers and should be treated as such. People who attack humans while we're on our back foot should be treated as the threats to humanity that they are.\n\nPKers should be given glowing red eyes that you can see from afar. That way you can tell who is evil just by seeing their eyes. A visual indicator that they are untrustworthy. That would balance the PvP significantly. That, along with increasing shield strength would make the game much more balanced. 2 hits to being downed is ridiculous, there's no time to react at all.", "timestamp_created": 1771112407, "timestamp_updated": 1771126647, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502291023731231689", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218339446", "author": {"steamid": "76561199042765168", "personaname": "Android16", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199042765168/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 27833, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7321, "deck_playtime_at_review": 8, "last_played": 1782793881, "avatar": "602979f6690683752c13a5acd8d5e396aeac6f2f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I wanted to like this game but there's so many things that are just stupid. Quests make no sense or glitch out all the time, Not enough enemy types, not enough weapons, and there's clear cheating going on in game that the devs do nothing about, along with the list of toxic players that either don't say anything and shoot you in the back or are extremely racist. Do Better.", "timestamp_created": 1771112361, "timestamp_updated": 1771112361, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.508651077747344971", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "writt